  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Perform message delivery to Apache Pulsar",
    "splashDescription": "The Pulsar connector allows processes in Camunda to publish messages directly to Apache Pulsar topics as part of BPMN execution. Acting as a bridge, the connector enables process automation scenarios to trigger events, notifications, or transactional data flows to any system integrated with Pulsar.",
